    gameplay: 'Partners play climbing combinations to empty hands, call Tichu bets, and use special cards such as Dragon, Phoenix, Dog, and Mah Jong. Points from captured cards and successful calls determine the score.',
    keyRules: [
      'Four players in two partnerships.',
      'Players climb with singles, pairs, sequences, full houses, and bombs.',
      'Tichu calls create major bonus or penalty swings.',
